 Rufus is convinced he has finally found a flawless plan for reaching Elysium, the paradise above. Events refuse to cooperate, and this time three versions of Rufus are causing trouble at once.\n\nPuzzles combine inventory items and conversation, with the same sarcastic, slapstick humor as before. Newcomers will be better served by starting earlier in the series. It is single-player, aimed at adventure fans who enjoy absurd comedy and long chains of puzzle logic."}}